    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The zombie apocalypse is here! \ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udc3e Choose your animal warrior \u2013 a brave cat with a pistol, a mighty crocodile with a bazooka, or a daring chicken with a revolver! More heroes await to be unlocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face endless hordes of zombies, fight for survival, and collect golden coins to upgrade your weapons and unlock new characters and maps. Every battle is a test of skill and endurance \u2013 how long can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Unique animal heroes, each with their own powerful weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Fast-paced action-packed gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Multiple maps to explore and conquer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Endless waves of zombies \u2013 the challenge never ends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Controls &amp; Goal:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your hero with simple and intuitive controls, aim, and shoot your way through endless zombie waves. Your mission? Survive as long as possible, eliminate zombies, and collect coins for upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Join the battle now! The world needs a hero \u2013 and that hero is YOU!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The zombie apocalypse is here! \ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2642\ufe0f\ud83d\udc3e Choose your animal warrior \u2013 a brave cat with a pistol, a mighty crocodile with a bazooka, or a daring chicken with a revolver! More heroes await to be unlocked.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face endless hordes of zombies, fight for survival, and collect golden coins to upgrade your weapons and unlock new characters and maps. Every battle is a test of skill and endurance \u2013 how long can you survive?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd25 Game Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Unique animal heroes, each with their own powerful weapon</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Fast-paced action-packed gameplay</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Multiple maps to explore and conquer</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 Endless waves of zombies \u2013 the challenge never ends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfae Controls &amp; Goal:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Move your hero with simple and intuitive controls, aim, and shoot your way through endless zombie waves. Your mission? Survive as long as possible, eliminate zombies, and collect coins for upgrades.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc3e Join the battle now! The world needs a hero \u2013 and that hero is YOU!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
